        "message": "fix(1): the split needs a matching versionCode, explicit build types, and no publishing\n\n    No matching variant of project ':ocr-fallback' was found. The consumer was\n    configured to find a component for use during 'android-reverse-meta-data' ...\n\nA dynamic feature is a SPLIT OF THE BASE APK, so it must agree with the base on\nversionCode and mirror its build types explicitly, and it must not publish\nreverse metadata. Declared all three. The error reads like a dependency\nresolution problem, which is why it took a variant-matching message to\ndiagnose.",
